          "requirement": "Advertise SETTINGS_NO_RFC7540_PRIORITIES=1 so valid request Priority headers can set and apply extensible stream priority.",
          "target_route": "The server receives HEADERS bytes, inflates request headers, dispatches Priority to http_request_on_header, then finishes the header block.",
